• Ensure the determination of parental contributions and ensure consistency of decisions taken;
• Participate in setting and achieving the objectives of the Finance Unit and assist the Unit Manager and her Deputy. For further information, please consult the specifications by clicking here or contact Ms Marina Brdar, Head of the Finance Unit, by e-mail to her secretariat lucia.giordano@vd.ch or 021 316 44 23.

• Bachelor of Economics (HES, UNI) or Specialist in Finance and Accounting;
• Team management training required;
• Experience in accounting and team management;
• Excellent mastery of common computer tools;
• Mastery of accounting, SAP or other LES standards;
• Knowledge of the financial processes and guidelines of Vaud State, an asset;
• Leadership with a spirit of decision and determination;
• Good self-control and stress management. Disclosure of any criminal history is required for this position.

Position in the Cantonal Administration of Vaud (State of Vaud), Switzerland. Online application on the official career portal offers-emploi.vd.ch.

